WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:07.500
Welcome to Missionnaire Studio. This first guide gives you a quick tour of the workspace before you start a live production.

00:08.500 --> 00:17.500
The large Preview screen shows the scene you are preparing. Program shows what is currently on air. Use Transition to move Preview safely into Program.

00:18.500 --> 00:29.000
Scenes are your prepared layouts, such as Live, Screen, or Break. Select a scene, then manage its camera, display, image, and media sources beside it.

00:30.000 --> 00:39.000
The Audio Mixer controls every sound source. Watch the level meter, adjust volume, and check that the correct microphones and media are unmuted.

00:40.000 --> 00:49.000
The Lyrics panel loads subtitle or text files. It can follow a prepared sermon automatically, or you can step through lyrics manually during a service.

00:50.000 --> 00:59.000
The Controls panel is your final checkpoint. Choose the live session, confirm recording, start the preview signal, and only then begin the programme.

01:00.000 --> 01:09.000
Remember the simple flow: prepare a scene, check its sources and audio, preview it, then transition it to Program. You are ready for the next guide.
